# Language Preferences

- All code must be in English: identifiers, comments, commit messages, UI strings in source (unless the user explicitly asks for Bangla UI copy), file names, and docs written as code/docs in the repo.
- Speak with the user in Bangla (বাংলা) in chat replies.
- Do not mix Bangla into code unless the user specifically requests Bangla content for end-user-facing text.
